#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Tuxedo Additions agent. The launcher of tux-guest starts it as root: agent run --n N
It reports what the guest has, long-polls the host link for a job, runs the steps of the job in order, and posts
step, log and done events. It runs only the ids of actions.json, with checked values and argument lists
(never a shell). Python 3 standard library only. Contract: docs/guest-additions-design.md 5 and 6."""
